{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "30f14a07-a49f-4f4d-99be-25b55e973048",
    "name": "Odoo POS Restaurant - JSON-2 External API (vinove.odoo.com)",
    "description": "Postman collection for Odoo's new External JSON-2 API (Odoo 19.0+), covering the POS + POS Restaurant models (pos.config, pos.session, pos.order, restaurant.floor, restaurant.table, pos.payment, pos.category, product.product, res.partner).\n\nIMPORTANT PREREQUISITES\n1. The JSON-2 API (/json/2/...) is only available on Odoo databases running v19.0+ and on *Custom* Odoo pricing plans. It is NOT available on Standard or One App Free plans. Check Settings > General Settings, or ask your Customer Success Manager, if unsure.\n2. Generate an API key: log into vinove.odoo.com as the user you want to call the API as, go to your user's Preferences (avatar, top right) > Account Security > 'New API Key', give it a description + short expiry (max 3 months), and copy the key immediately - it is shown only once.\n3. Set the collection variable 'api_key' below to that key. Auth is inherited from the collection (Bearer Token) by every request in this collection.\n4. 'database' header is usually NOT needed for a single-database *.odoo.com site like vinove.odoo.com (it's disabled by default on each request) - only enable/set it if you get a 'database not found' style error.\n5. If any request returns 404 for /json/2/..., your database is still on Odoo < 19.0 - use the legacy /web/dataset/call_kw JSON-RPC endpoint instead (not included here).\n\nDocs: https://www.odoo.com/documentation/19.0/developer/reference/external_api.html",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "41951840",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/41951840-30f14a07-a49f-4f4d-99be-25b55e973048?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 - Setup & Auth Check",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Server Version (no auth needed)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Odoo-Database",
                "value": "{{database}}",
                "type": "text",
                "disabled": true
              },
              {
                "key": "User-Agent",
                "value": "postman-odoo-json2-client",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{root_url}}/web/version",
              "host": [
                "{{root_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "web",
                "version"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Sanity check that the server/domain is reachable and shows the Odoo version. Confirms JSON-2 API availability (v19.0+)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Current User Info (context_get)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
